'''Crazed Axe Cat''' (狂乱のバトルネコ, ''Kyōran no Batoru Neko'', '''Frenzy Axe Cat''', '''''Frenzy Battle Cat''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Berserk (Insane)|Berserk]], where it can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

