==Enemy==
It deals heavy Area Attack damage with a [[Freeze|freezing]] effect, making it very hard to deal with. The [[Berserk (Insane)|first stage in which it appears]] spawns [[Shy Boy]]s and other [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, so it is best to bring many [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units.

